Package: morar
Title: Housing Affordability Analysis for Brazil
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vinicius", "Oike", email = "CHANGE-ME@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Mortgage and housing affordability calculations following
    Brazilian market conventions. Implements SAC, Price and mixed
    amortization, the inversion between income and maximum financeable
    price, full amortization schedules, and affordability indices (HAI and
    price-to-income ratio). All core functions are vectorized so they can be
    applied to entire income or price distributions.
